	(text "RGB status LED: WS2812B-2020-V6 on +3V3_UI (GPIO46 = RGB_DIN)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9979bfe1-4989-5f76-9d6c-759b1d5f1495")
	)
	(text "3.3-5.3 V part (LCSC C52917434), so no level shifter: DIN at 3.3 V logic = VDD. Off with +3V3_UI in sleep.\nR55 100k pull-down: GPIO46 is a strap (must be 0/float at reset). 100n at VDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 135.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
